{"video":"gFEspUJEKqk","lines":[{"t":[0,5.8],"en":"The panda?"},{"t":[5.8,9.2],"en":"You got the panda in my house?"},{"t":[9.2,11.7],"en":"No, I've been trying to get rid of this."},{"t":[11.7,13.7],"en":"You know the panda?"},{"t":[13.7,16.7],"en":"Man, that free panda bear's been showing up around me"},{"t":[16.7,18],"en":"for three years now."},{"t":[18,22.4],"en":"My house, my health club, my trip to Acapulco."},{"t":[22.4,24.8],"en":"That's why I bought this new house."},{"t":[24.8,27],"en":"Hey, who gave the panda my new address?"},{"t":[27,31],"en":"Oh, I don't know. Nobody knows nothing."},{"t":[31,32],"en":"OK, you know what?"},{"t":[32,34],"en":"I want somebody to catch that panda"},{"t":[34,36],"en":"and wrestle him through the grind and call the police."},{"t":[36,38],"en":"Or animal control or something."},{"t":[38,39.5],"en":"Oh, keep doing it!"},{"t":[39.5,41.2],"en":"Oh, I'm going to slam that panda!"},{"t":[41.2,43.2],"en":"Come on, where's my baseball bat?"},{"t":[43.2,44.2],"en":"I don't know."},{"t":[47.4,48.3],"en":"Where?"},{"t":[48.3,50],"en":"That closet right there."},{"t":[50,52.8],"en":"At midnight, he's expecting us to have our 100 day kiss."},{"t":[52.8,54.4],"en":"OK, OK, that's perfect."},{"t":[54.4,55.4],"en":"So you just text him?"},{"t":[55.4,56.4],"en":"Hey!"},{"t":[56.4,60.4],"en":"Hey, where'd the panda go?"},{"t":[60.4,61.4],"en":"No way!"},{"t":[61.4,62.3],"en":"Kenan Thompson!"},{"t":[62.3,63.3],"en":"You're Kenan!"},{"t":[63.3,64.3],"en":"Oh my God!"},{"t":[64.3,65.3],"en":"Yeah, she's famous."},{"t":[65.3,66.3],"en":"Where'd the panda go?"},{"t":[66.3,67.3],"en":"Where'd the panda go?"},{"t":[67.3,68.3],"en":"Uh, we don't know."},{"t":[68.3,69.8],"en":"Oh, ma'am."},{"t":[69.8,73.3],"en":"How does that funky panda keep escaping my grasp?"},{"t":[73.3,75.3],"en":"I'm Carly, on the internet."},{"t":[75.3,76.3],"en":"Oh, yeah."},{"t":[76.3,77.3],"en":"Yeah, yeah."},{"t":[77.3,78.3],"en":"Do you know us?"},{"t":[78.3,81.3],"en":