, we took it down to the--"},{"t":[146.6,148.9],"en":"Oh, hang on."},{"t":[148.9,151.3],"en":"Text from Tori."},{"t":[151.3,154.7],"en":"Ooh, time for a 100-day kiss."},{"t":[154.7,155.7],"en":"Late."},{"t":[160.2,162.2],"en":"I don't know what it is."},{"t":[162.2,163.2],"en":"Oh."},{"t":[195.7,198.1],"en":"Wait, what is this?"},{"t":[198.1,201.2],"en":"This is iCarly!"},{"t":[201.2,202],"en":"Woo!"},{"t":[202,203],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[203,204],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[204,205],"en":"Hi, Carly!"},{"t":[205,206.1],"en":"Yeah!"},{"t":[206.1,209.1],"en":"And that is my ex-boyfriend, Steven."},{"t":[209.1,210.1],"en":"Ex?"},{"t":[210.1,212.5],"en":"He is also her ex-boyfriend."},{"t":[214.5,215.5],"en":"Ex?"},{"t":[215.5,219],"en":"Yes, ex, meaning not anymore."},{"t":[220.6,225.1],"en":"See, Steven used to have two girlfriends at the same time."},{"t":[225.1,225.6],"en":"Me?"},{"t":[225.6,226.6],"en":"And her."},{"t":[228.1,229.6],"en":"Steven's a cheater."},{"t":[230.1,231.3],"en":"And a liar."},{"t":[234.3,237.3],"en":"But now Steven's got a new girlfriend."},{"t":[237.8,239.3],"en":"And might never get one again."},{"t":[239.3,242.2],"en":"Yeah, because now all y'all women out there"},{"t":[242.2,246.4],"en":"know that Steven is a cheesy-wast skunk bag!"},{"t":[247.2,249.1],"en":"Wait, this is live on iCarly?"},{"t":[249.3,251.3],"en":"Uh-huh, but don't worry."},{"t":[251.3,253.9],"en":"Only like a million people are watching, so."},{"t":[253.9,256.3],"en":"Yeah, so it's not like your whole life's over."},{"t":[257.1,258.1],"en":"Oh, wait."},{"t":[258.1,260.4],"en":"It kinda is!"},{"t":[261.9,262.9],"en":"You know what?"},{"t":[263.9,264.8],"en":"Ah!"},{"t":[268.5,271.2],"en":"Bye, Steven!"},{"t":[271.7,273.6],"en":"- And go! - And go!"},{"t":[273.7,278.7],"en":"- You know the age! - Oh, my God!"},{"t":[283.5,286.6],"en":"- He got such it! - Here comes the big wave!"},{"t":[287.5,288.8],"en":"I'm gonna do it!"},{"t":[292.2,294.8],"en":"- Now, I understand. - Huh?"},{"t":